{"user": "why did c8 lose there", "user_ts": "2026-08-20T02:23:17.192480+00:00", "assistant": "c8 lost because it was an **unstable edge move**: it flipped discs immediately, but it didn\u2019t secure the **a8 corner** or the bottom edge.\n\nAfter that, White could finish by taking/owning the **bottom-left area**, and those edge discs became **permanent White discs**. In the final board, White has **a8 and almost the whole bottom/left side**, while Black only has **14 discs** total.\n\nSo the issue was: **c8 won discs now, but lost control of stable corners/edges and final parity.** In endgames, that\u2019s usually fatal.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-20T02:23:28.145611+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-20T02:23:30.260335+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Negative Feedback": 1, "Board Report": 2, "Worked Line": 1, "Neutral Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Negative Feedback": 0.3333333333333333, "Board Report": 0.6666666666666666, "Worked Line": 0.3333333333333333, "Neutral Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "llama": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid"